### Report a client-side error, logged to app.log as it happens (rate-limited per IP)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/client-errors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'id')",
  "page": "http://localhost:4200/uebersicht",
  "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0 Chrome/128"
}

### page and userAgent are optional - a report without them still goes out
POST {{baseApiPath}}/client-errors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Unbehandelter Promise-Fehler: Error: backend nicht erreichbar"
}
